{
  "info": {
    "name": "CampusOverflow v1.0 · Lab4 提交物",
    "description": "CampusOverflow 公开 API 集合，覆盖认证、问答、声誉、悬赏、搜索、通知与管理员对账。\n\n认证方式：服务端会话 Cookie（SESSION）+ CSRF 双提交 Cookie（XSRF-TOKEN → X-XSRF-TOKEN）。集合级 pre-request 脚本会自动从 Cookie Jar 读取 XSRF-TOKEN 并写入请求头，因此只需按顺序跑完「00 准备」即可。\n\n核心成功用例：`02 问题 / 发布问题`，断言 201 Created 并把返回的 id 存入 `questionId` 变量，供后续请求复用。\n\n前置条件：后端已启动（默认 http://localhost:8080），或在集合变量 `baseUrl` 中改为实际地址。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 准备",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "获取 CSRF Token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 返回 CSRF token', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('csrf', body.token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/csrf",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "csrf"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "01 认证",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "注册学生（随机账号，可重复执行）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const suffix = Date.now().toString().slice(-8);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('regUsername', 't' + suffix);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('regDisplay', 'u' + suffix);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('regEmail', 'u' + suffix + '@example.com');"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 注册成功', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('返回用户 id', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().id).to.be.a('number'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{regUsername}}\",\n  \"displayName\": \"{{regDisplay}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{regEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"college\": \"湖北文理学院\",\n  \"className\": \"计算机2411\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "登录（保存会话 Cookie）",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 登录成功', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const me = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('返回当前用户', () => pm.expect(me).to.have.property('displayName'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('meId', me.id);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{regUsername}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "当前登录用户",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test('200 返回本人资料', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "me"]
            }
          },
          "response": []
